sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Launch / reopen / menu
    participant D as Application delegate
    participant W as Retained Settings window
    participant A as NSApp
    C->>D: Show requested section once
    alt Server or port unavailable
        D-->>C: Return without either request
    else Ready
        D->>W: Create only if absent and keep identity
        Note over D,W: Configure window and apply requested section first
        D->>A: Request activation once
        A-->>D: Call returns
        Note over D,A: Return does not establish active state
        D->>W: Request key and front ordering once
        W-->>D: Call returns
        D-->>C: Return without retry or deferral
    end
    Note over C,A: Application order applied again for issue #15, with discretionary macOS outcome
